Multiheaded Attacks		KEY:Multiheaded ~ Attacks		CATEGORY:Special Ability		TYPE:Extraordinary.SpecialAttack		DESC:If you have a breath weapon, or a spit, spray, ray, or cone attack that originates from your head, each head has this attack.  e.g.; if you have a breath weapon, all heads have that breath weapon.  They activate on the same round, but can be aimed in different directions.

