Rage		CATEGORY:Special Ability	KEY:Broodguard ~ Rage		DESC:Once per day, a broodguard can enter into a berserk state similar to a barbarian’s rage. In this state, the broodguard gains +4 to Strength, +4 to Constitution, and a +2 morale bonus on Will saves, but it takes a –2 penalty to Armor Class. The rage lasts for a number of rounds equal to 3 + the broodguard’s (newly improved) Constitution modifier.		TEMPBONUS:PC|STAT|STR|4			TEMPBONUS:PC|STAT|CON|4		TEMPBONUS:PC|COMBAT|AC|-2			TEMPDESC:Apply a +2 bonus to will save rolls		
